Memory management:
  * [DONE] Refactor?
  * Introduce proper singular API to allocate virtual memory (which should
    allocated physical memory and map it) and physical memory
  * Introduce zones (mmap?) in virtual memory
    - This would allow us to provide robust implementation for `demand paging` and improve heap allocations
    - This would allow us to implement COW (Copy On Write)
    - This would allow us to check the user pointer passed to system calls

